@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Design sequence · UC08 Publish and archive the film
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam Padding 0
skinparam sequence {
 MessageSpacing 0
 ParticipantPadding 5
 BoxPadding 3
}
skinparam ParticipantFontSize 19
skinparam SequenceGroupHeaderFontSize 19
skinparam maxMessageSize 500
skinparam sequenceMessageSpan true
participant "scheduler.ts\n«module»" as S
participant "lifecycle.ts\n«module»" as L
participant "stored-output.ts\n«module»" as O
participant ":MediaStore\n«interface»" as M
participant ":RewindDatabase" as DB
S -> L : publishCycleReleaseWithStore()
L -> O : verifyReadyJobOutput() via verifyCompilationOutput()
O -> M : head() + read() · verifyStoredMedia()
O -> DB : compare current ready row to verified row
alt proof missing / changed
 L --> S : not_ready
else proof + revealing + now >= ends_at
 L -> DB : txn: UPDATE published + release_published_at; COMMIT
 L --> S : published / already_published
end
ref over S,DB : 24 h later: advanceCycleLifecycleWithStore() re-verifies output,\nthen transactionally archives + adds lifecycle event (see state-cycle)
@enduml
